title: $:/plugins/yan/hypergsd/readme

This is the main HyperGSD plugin, enabling you to manage your tasks better.

HyperGSD is highly customisable. Out of the box, it provides a two-part way of organising your work, with discrete "Capture" (collecting tasks) and "Review" (sorting and prioritising tasks) steps. You can find tools for both these process in the sidebar.

The plugin provides:

* Actions (tagged $:/GSD/Action)
* Projects, which can contain actions or other projects (tagged $:/GSD/Project)
* Realms, to help compartmentalise different domains of interest. Realms as simple tags (add from Migrating tiddler)
* Several dashboards which can be found in the "Review" sidebar. These are mainly composed from re-usable lists that you can configure in HyperGSD's list settings.
* Cleanup dashboards
* A platform for expansion with other plugins

